{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def _digit_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Returns sum of decimal digits of n, treating negative by absolute value.\n    Converts the number to a string to sum its digits.\n    \"\"\"\n    s = 0\n    for char_digit in str(abs(n)):\n        s += int(char_digit)\n    return s\n\ndef sum_of_digits(numbers: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the sum of digits of each number of a given list and returns the total sum.\n    This function delegates digit sum computation for individual numbers to a helper.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum_all_digits = 0\n    for num in numbers:\n        total_sum_all_digits += _digit_sum(num)\n    return total_sum_all_digits"}
