{"task_id": "Mbpp/414", "solution": "def overlapping(seq1, seq2) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Return True if any element in seq1 == any element in seq2, otherwise False.\n\n    Returns False if either seq1 or seq2 is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not seq1 or not seq2:\n        return False\n\n    for e1 in seq1:\n        for e2 in seq2:\n            if e1 == e2:\n                return True\n    return False"}
